# Urban Traffic Management System

Unity-based traffic control system with REST API and automated Ansible deployment.

## Requirements
- **OS**: Ubuntu 22.04 LTS
- **Memory**: 4GB RAM minimum
- **Storage**: 8GB
- **Network**: SSH (port 22), HTTP (port 5000)

## Quick Deployment

1. **Download files:**
   ```
   wget https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IamHermanto/traffic-simulation-deployment/main/deploy.yml
   wget https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IamHermanto/traffic-simulation-deployment/main/inventory.ini.template
   ```

2. **Configure server:**
   ```
   cp inventory.ini.template inventory.ini
   # Edit inventory.ini with your server hostname and SSH key path
   ```

3. **Deploy:**
   ```
   ansible-playbook -i inventory.ini deploy.yml
   ```

## Access
- **Dashboard**: `http://your-server:5000/dashboard`
- **API**: `http://your-server:5000/api/status`

## Key API Endpoints
```
# System status
curl http://your-server:5000/api/status

# Control all lights
curl -X POST http://your-server:5000/api/traffic/lights/set_all_red
curl -X POST http://your-server:5000/api/traffic/lights/set_all_green
curl -X POST http://your-server:5000/api/traffic/lights/randomize

# Restore normal operation
curl -X POST http://your-server:5000/api/traffic/system/restore
```